  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nThe corner radius of the Chatbox is is not really unified, when a message only needs one line it's tiny and when a message uses multiple lines it gets bigger. This is a bit annoying it makes it not as nice looking as it could be.\n# Suggestion:\nUse a unified corner radius for the Chatbox which always stays the same, the only thing that should change when a message needs more lines is the distance between the corners. Right now it feels like the Chatbox background is just getting scaled bigger / smaller.\nThe corner radius when you use all 144 Characters feels most fitting with he rest of the Nameplate.\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see that the corner radius is depending on how long my message is: https://streamable.com/rcd65s",
